<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | Satyam Singh</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Satyam Singh's portfolio website. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data.">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <%- include('partials/meta-pixel') %>
    <style>
        .policy-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.05) 0%, rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.02) 100%);
            padding: 60px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .policy-header h1 {
            color: var(--lightest-slate);
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .policy-header p {
            color: var(--slate);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .policy-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 25px 80px 25px;
        }

        .policy-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .policy-section h2 {
            color: var(--lightest-slate);
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .policy-section h2 i {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .policy-section h3 {
            color: var(--light-slate);
            font-size: 1.1em;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .policy-section p,
        .policy-section li {
            color: var(--slate);
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .policy-section ul {
            margin-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .policy-section li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.05);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .highlight-box strong {
            color: var(--lightest-slate);
        }

        .table-of-contents {
            background: var(--light-navy);
            border: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .table-of-contents h3 {
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .table-of-contents ul {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .table-of-contents li {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        .table-of-contents a {
            color: var(--light-slate);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .table-of-contents a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .contact-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.05) 0%, rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.02) 100%);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .contact-info h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .contact-info p {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .last-updated {
            color: var(--slate);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.1);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .policy-header {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }
            .policy-header h1 {
                font-size: 1.8em;
            }
            .policy-section h2 {
                font-size: 1.2em;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Fixed Side Elements -->
    <div class="side-element left">
        <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/saty5685" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/saty5685/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://leetcode.com/saty5685" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LeetCode"><i class="fas fa-code"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://hackerrank.com/saty5685" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="HackerRank"><i class="fab fa-hackerrank"></i></a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header id="header" class="scrolled">
        <nav>
            <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Home"><img src="/images/favicon.svg" alt="SS" class="logo-icon"></a>
            <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <ol>
                    <li><a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a></li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Toggle menu">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </button>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="policy-header">
            <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Last Updated: May 13, 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-container">
            <!-- Table of Contents -->
            <div class="table-of-contents">
                <h3>📋 Table of Contents</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#introduction">Introduction</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#data-collection">Data We Collect</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#how-we-use">How We Use Your Data</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#third-party">Third-Party Services</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#data-security">Data Security</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#your-rights">Your Rights</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">Contact Us</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Introduction -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="introduction">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    Welcome to my portfolio website (hereinafter "Website"). I am committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring you have a positive experience on my platform. This Privacy Policy explains how I collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit my Website.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, please do not use our Website.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Data Collection -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="data-collection">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-database"></i> Data We Collect</h2>

                <h3>1. Information You Provide Directly</h3>
                <p>When you submit the contact form on my Website, I collect the following information:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Name:</strong> Your full name</li>
                    <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> Your contact email</li>
                    <li><strong>Subject:</strong> Topic of your inquiry</li>
                    <li><strong>Message:</strong> Your inquiry or message content</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2. Information Collected Automatically</h3>
                <p>I also automatically collect certain information about your device and browsing activity:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>IP Address:</strong> Your Internet Protocol address (hashed for privacy)</li>
                    <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Approximate geographical location based on IP address (country, city, timezone)</li>
                    <li><strong>User Agent:</strong> Information about your browser and operating system</li>
                    <li><strong>Pages Visited:</strong> Which pages on my Website you access</li>
                    <li><strong>Visit Count:</strong> How many times you visit and when</li>
                    <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device type, browser type, and operating system</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="highlight-box">
                    <strong>Note:</strong> IP addresses are never stored in plain text. They are hashed for security purposes, and original IPs are not logged.
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- How We Use -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="how-we-use">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> How We Use Your Data</h2>

                <h3>1. Contact Form Information</h3>
                <p>Information you provide through the contact form is used to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Respond to your inquiry or message</li>
                    <li>Contact you regarding business opportunities or collaborations</li>
                    <li>Improve Website content and services</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2. Visitor Analytics</h3>
                <p>Automatically collected visitor information is used to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Understand Website traffic patterns and user behavior</li>
                    <li>Improve Website performance and user experience</li>
                    <li>Debug technical issues</li>
                    <li>Prevent fraud and unauthorized access</li>
                    <li>Generate anonymized analytics reports</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>3. Meta Pixel Tracking</h3>
                <p>
                    I use Meta Pixel (Facebook's tracking technology) on my Website to:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Track page views and user interactions</li>
                    <li>Measure conversion events (e.g., contact form submissions)</li>
                    <li>Retarget users with personalized advertisements</li>
                    <li>Build audience insights for marketing purposes</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    Meta Pixel allows me to better understand my audience and deliver targeted advertising on Facebook, Instagram, and other platforms.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Third-Party Services -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="third-party">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-link"></i> Third-Party Services</h2>

                <h3>Meta Pixel / Facebook</h3>
                <p>
                    My Website uses Meta Pixel, a tool provided by Meta Platforms, Inc. Meta Pixel tracks your activity on my Website and shares this data with Meta for advertising and analytics purposes.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Meta's Privacy Policy:</strong> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/explanation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.facebook.com/privacy/explanation</a>
                </p>

                <h3>GeoIP Database</h3>
                <p>
                    I use GeoIP-Lite to determine your approximate location (country, city) based on your IP address for analytics purposes. This data is used internally and never shared with third parties.
                </p>

                <div class="highlight-box">
                    <strong>Important:</strong> I do not sell your personal data to any third parties. Data is only shared as necessary to provide services (e.g., Meta Pixel tracking for advertising).
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Data Security -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="data-security">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-lock"></i> Data Security</h2>

                <h3>Security Measures</h3>
                <p>
                    I implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal information, including:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>HTTPS encryption for data in transit</li>
                    <li>IP address hashing to prevent direct IP identification</li>
                    <li>Secure server infrastructure</li>
                    <li>Limited access to personal data</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Limitations</h3>
                <p>
                    While I strive to protect your information, no security system is impenetrable. I cannot guarantee absolute security of your data. You use my Website at your own risk.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Your Rights -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="your-rights">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-user-check"></i> Your Rights</h2>

                <h3>Access & Correction</h3>
                <p>
                    You have the right to access, review, and correct any personal information I have collected from you. Please contact me using the information below to exercise this right.
                </p>

                <h3>Deletion Requests</h3>
                <p>
                    You may request the deletion of your personal data. Upon verification of your identity, I will remove your information from my records and internal systems.
                </p>

                <h3>Opt-Out of Meta Pixel Tracking</h3>
                <p>
                    You can opt out of Meta Pixel tracking by:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Disabling cookies in your browser settings</li>
                    <li>Using a browser extension that blocks tracking pixels</li>
                    <li>Visiting Meta's <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ad Preferences Center</a></li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Do Not Track</h3>
                <p>
                    Some browsers include a "Do Not Track" (DNT) feature. While I respect privacy preferences, I currently do not respond to DNT signals. However, you can manage your preferences through your browser settings.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Contact Us -->
            <section class="policy-section" id="contact">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, or if you wish to exercise your rights regarding your personal data, please contact me:
                </p>
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <h3>Contact Information</h3>
                    <p><strong>Name:</strong> Satyam Singh</p>
                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:saty5685@gmail.com">saty5685@gmail.com</a></p>
                    <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> I will respond to your inquiry within 7 business days</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Policy Changes -->
            <section class="policy-section">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Policy Updates</h2>
                <p>
                    I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in my practices or applicable laws. I will notify you of any significant changes by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Continued use of my Website following the posting of revised Privacy Policy means you accept and agree to the changes.
                </p>
            </section>

            <div class="last-updated">
                Last Updated: May 13, 2026
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
